    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nEd Dempsey & Associates are delighted to present this pristine fully furnished two-bedroom period townhouse to the rental market. \n\nPerched on Long Lane, Dublin 8, a quiet one-way residential laneway. Internally the accommodation comprised a spacious living room with open fire, well-appointed kitchen featuring all mod cons, main bathroom and two bedrooms. The South-facing Garden is a perfect oasis to relax after a long day. \n\nThe city centre is a 10-15-minute walk away and public transport options are abundant including a series of central bus routes, numerous DublinBikes hubs and the Green Line LUAS, accessible via the Harcourt LUAS stop. The city centre at your doorstep boasts endless amenities such as Dublin Castle, St. Patrick's Park, St. Stephen's Green and the Teelings Whiskey Distillery, to name but a few, within walking distance......."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Two Bedroom Mid-Terrace Period Townhouse.</li><li> Living Room with Open Fire</li><li> Kitchen fully fitted & furnished with appliances like oven & hob, washing machine, dishwasher and under-counter fridge freezer.</li><li> Two Generous Bedrooms</li><li> Well-Appointed Main Bathroom</li><li> South Facing Rear Patio</li><li> Gas Fired Central Heating</li><li> One-month Deposit</li><li> Minimum one year renting term</ul>"
      },
